=== 3. Reading ===
  The feature is a STEP in a data product (the like-for-like sigma table) at the 25 m GLODAP bin edge the mixed-layer base crosses,
  rendered as a 1-2 m sigmoid by the Hermite interpolant. The shipped acceptance ('measured roughness at most 0.0734 log-units') was
  priced at a mode where the rows' residuals were small; at hilda31 the d13C row is ~3 sigma out, so the same step costs ~0.5.
  It is NOT the pump-shape kink family (hml_kinks; those stay gone) and NOT a model discontinuity: a sampler crosses a C1 shelf; a
  Hessian step search does not. Whether to smooth or re-bin the table is a ruling (it changes the objective).
